      "TEXT": "Emp Valley Enter",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ogre \n\u0022You Humans think you can own this valley? This a Greenskin valley! Stay out!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Cap Gnarthwood",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022This city is an important step in the control of the valley. If the Clans had control of it, it would cause great problems for our campaign...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022The Greenskins were well equipped, we recovered the Tome Of War from their vaults.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225UN003e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Goblin",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Cap Runia",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Finally we have captured Runia. It was an important outpost for the Greenskins... We should be careful, they may retaliate.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225UN0040",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Kill Thalrisa",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022It seems that ghost, Thalrisa was guarding the entrance to this hidden valley. I would not dare to imagine what other horrors lay sleeping inside...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Loot Abandoned Farm",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022This structure is very old, Milord! It is obvious that the Greenskins have been in the valley for a very long time now. But why? The magic?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV001f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Loot Thalrisa\u0027s Templ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV001f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022We have broken Thalrisa\u0027s curse. She is gone back to the Infernal Dominion from which she was created. We may now harvest the mana without her interference.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225UN0043",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc Champion",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0020",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Spawn2 Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0020",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Scout \n\u0022We have received word that Orc Reinforcements are arriving! They may be headed for our capital!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0021",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Spawn2 Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0021",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Scout \n\u0022We have received word that Orc Reinforcements are arriving! They may be headed for the Capital!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Thalrisa Story",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thalrisa \n\u0022I have waited so long to face my enemies... Finally I will have revenge on those who persecuted me, and I will be rid of you as you tried to get rid of me... Even though my poor Elemental Guardians melted away, I will have my revenge!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0023",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Enable Spawn 1",
