      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022It seems that ghost, Thalrisa was guarding the entrance to this hidden valley. I would not dare to imagine what other horrors lay sleeping inside...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loc Orc Warning",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc Champion \n\u0022Nobody must own these evil grounds... Magic is bad!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225UN0026",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Cap Runia",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Finally we have captured Runia. It was an important outpost for the Greenskins... We should be careful, they may retaliate\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Thalrisa Story",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thalrisa \n\u0022I have waited so long to face my enemies... Finally I will have revenge on those who persecuted me, and I will be rid of you as you tried to get rid of me... Even though my poor Elemental Guardians melted away, I will have my revenge!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225UN002a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ogre",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022We have been commissioned by the High King to colonize this valley to collect the large amounts of mana present.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Unfortunately, the magic-fearing Greenskins have discovered our plans and are determined to rid us of the valley. The Empire, on the other hand, wishes to claim this valley as their own.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022They have set a siege on our valley to attempt to stifle us into submission. To break the siege, we must send a messenger to the valley\u0027s entrance to the southeast to call for help from the neighboring Clans.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225UN002d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Goblin",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loc Orc Trap",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Orc Meeting",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc Champion \n\u0022Grr! You will not survive long here, Dwarves! It was a mistake for you to come, we warned you! Now you will never leave alive!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Runia Entrance",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc Guard \n\u0022You invade this valley and now you think you invade our villages? You Dwarves more foolish than we think!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spawn1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Enable Spawn 2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spawn2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loc Thalrisa\u0027s magic",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc \n\u0022You want Thalrisa\u0027s Magic, but we will never let you have it! You will not hurt Greenskins!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Loot Abandoned Farm",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022This structure is very old, Milord! It is obvious that the Greenskins have been in the valley for a very long time now. But why? The magic?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Enter Valley of Horrors",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Thalrisa\u0027s servants live still! They must be seeking revenge!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Loot Thalrisas Temple",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022We have broken Thalrisa\u0027s curse. She is gone back to the Infernal Dominion from which she was created. We may now harvest the mana without her interference.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022The Empire scouts not long ago returned with word of the Mountain Clans movements in this valley. When we found out the reason for the Clans\u0027 establishment in the region we realized the Empire must step in.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022The magic resources here are extremely valuable. The Clans will no doubt attempt to send for help. This is why we\u0027ve laid a siege at the mouth of the valley. With no backup, it is only a matter of time before they are forced into submission.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022An experienced warrior, Sir Glorcliff, will lead the attack on their capital. We must proceed without delay.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Runia Entrance",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc \n\u0022You invade this valley and now you think you invade our villages? You Humans more foolish than we think!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Win1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225UN003a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Goblin Spy",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S225SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S225EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Win3",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    }
  ]
